## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Quests
## Notes: Quest-ready alerts with a QUEST COMPLETE banner, optional automatic accept and turn-in, a current-zone filter, progressed quests first in the quest log with a glow, sorting by name, the items of a quest beside its details, party progress, reward sell prices and quest experience totals.
